    paths = [
      cudaPackages.cudatoolkit
      cudaPackages.cuda_cudart
      cudaPackages.cuda_cudart.static
    ];
    postBuild = ''
      rm "$out/lib64
'';

the comment you linked specifically mentions "cuda toolkit" and explains it's needed for nvcc, which in your case is exactly what nvidia-cuda-toolkit provides.

Do not install cuda, install nvidia-cuda-toolkit.

